{"unit":6,"no":22,"title":"Where your food comes from","blurb":"Unit 6","VOCAB":[["boil","","варить","қайнату",""],["fry","","жарить","қуыру",""],["roast","","запекать (мясо)","қақтау",""],["bake","","печь","пісіру",""],["grill","","жарить на гриле","грильде пісіру",""],["mix","","смешать","араластыру",""],["add","","добавить","қосу",""],["chop","","нарезать","турау",""],["heat","","разогреть","қыздыру",""],["serve","","подавать","ұсыну",""],["recipe","","рецепт","рецепт",""],["ingredients","","ингредиенты","құрамдас бөліктер",""],["a quarter","","четверть","ширек",""],["per cent","","процент","пайыз",""]],"SLIDES":[["🥕","How many carrots do we need?"]],"PICWORDS":["boil","fry","roast","bake","grill","mix","add","chop","heat","serve","recipe","ingredients","a quarter","per cent"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"9_9":"A1_L22_9_9.mp3","9_14":"A1_L22_9_14.mp3","9_20":"A1_L22_9_20.mp3","9_10":"A1_L22_9_10.mp3","9_13":"A1_L22_9_13.mp3"},"SEGS":{"9_9":[3.39,null],"9_14":[4.72,null],"9_20":[3.35,null],"9_10":[3.38,null],"9_13":[3.73,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>Where your food comes from</h2>\n      <p>Say how much or how many there is — and describe how you cook something.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes, top to bottom.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>After each <b>Check answers</b>, read the note — that is your teacher.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">How much do you cook?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap one. Be honest!</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>👨‍🍳</b> &nbsp;every day, real dishes</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🍳</b> &nbsp;eggs and pasta — that's my level</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🫕</b> &nbsp;I help… by eating</div><div class=\"card\"><b>📱</b> &nbsp;my best recipe is a delivery app</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">These are your cooking words for this lesson.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap 🔊 to listen. Turn on translations only if you need them.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('9_9',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 9.9 — cooking verbs in real sentences</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 You boil water in a kettle to make tea. 2 For breakfast I often fry eggs, mushrooms and tomatoes together in a big frying pan. 3 To roast meat, you need a very hot oven. 4 Mix the water and flour together in a bowl with a spoon. 5 Not many people bake their own bread or cakes at home these days. 6 You need to use a sharp knife to chop the onions.</div></details>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Recall\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Recall</div>\n      <h2>Recall</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Choose the correct cooking verb.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s3SSt1\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ the water for tea.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Boil</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Chop</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Fry</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">___ the eggs in a frying pan.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Bake</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Boil</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Fry</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ the meat in a very hot oven.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Roast</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Mix</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Boil</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">___ the onions with a sharp knife.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Serve</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Boil</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Chop</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">___ the water and flour together in a bowl.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Heat</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Mix</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Boil</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">___ your own bread at home.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Boil</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Bake</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Chop</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>boil water · fry eggs · roast meat · chop onions · mix in a bowl · bake bread.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Match the verb to the food.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Tap a verb, then tap its food.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\"><b>Verb</b> &rarr; <b>Food</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s3GRt3\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>boil</b> <select data-answer=\"water for tea\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>fry</b> <select data-answer=\"eggs in a pan\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>roast</b> <select data-answer=\"meat in the oven\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>chop</b> <select data-answer=\"the onions\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>bake</b> <select data-answer=\"bread and cakes\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>mix</b> <select data-answer=\"water and flour\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Match the verb to the food.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Tap a verb, then tap its food.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\"><b>Verb</b> &rarr; <b>Food</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s3OOt5\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>boil</b> <select data-answer=\"water for tea\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>fry</b> <select data-answer=\"eggs in a pan\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>roast</b> <select data-answer=\"meat in the oven\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>chop</b> <select data-answer=\"the onions\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>bake</b> <select data-answer=\"bread and cakes\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>mix</b> <select data-answer=\"water and flour\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"water for tea\">water for tea</option><option value=\"eggs in a pan\">eggs in a pan</option><option value=\"meat in the oven\">meat in the oven</option><option value=\"the onions\">the onions</option><option value=\"bread and cakes\">bread and cakes</option><option value=\"water and flour\">water and flour</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">How much? How many? A little, a few, a lot of.</div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>“<b>How many</b> carrots do we need?” — “Three.”</div><div>“<b>How much</b> rice is there?” — “Two cups.”</div><div>“Add <b>a little</b> oil and <b>a few</b> raisins.”</div><div>“Don't add <b>too much</b> water!”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Notice:</span> carrots take <b>many / a few</b>; rice takes <b>much / a little</b>. Why?</p></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:18px;overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"gtable\"><tbody><tr><th>Quantifier</th><th>Goes with</th><th>Example</th></tr><tr><td class=\"pos\">How many…?</td><td>countable</td><td><b>How many</b> carrots do we need?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"pos\">How much…?</td><td>uncountable</td><td><b>How much</b> rice is there?</td></tr><tr><td class=\"pos\">a lot of</td><td>both</td><td><b>a lot of</b> patience · <b>a lot of</b> onions</td></tr><tr><td class=\"pos\">a few</td><td>countable</td><td>Add <b>a few</b> raisins.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"pos\">a little</td><td>uncountable</td><td>Add <b>a little</b> oil.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"pos\">too much / too many</td><td>more than is good</td><td>Don't add <b>too much</b> water!</td></tr><tr><td class=\"neg\">not enough</td><td>less than you need</td><td>There isn't <b>enough</b> salt.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>Countable → <b>how many, a few, too many</b>. Uncountable → <b>how much, a little, too much</b>.</div><div><b>a lot of</b> is the easy one — it works with both.</div><div><b>not enough</b> = you need more: There isn't enough salt.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Numbers\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Numbers</div>\n      <h2>Numbers</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Fractions, percentages, degrees.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">a quarter · a third · a half · three-quarters · fifteen per cent · minus seven degrees</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('9_14',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 9.14 — how to say the numbers</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">Fractions: a quarter (¼), a third (1/3), a half (½), three-quarters (¾), two-thirds (2/3). Percentages: fifteen per cent (15%), four point seven per cent (4.7%). Decimals: two point eight nine (2.89). Temperatures: twenty-two degrees Celsius (22°C), minus seven (-7°C). Dates: the first of September.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('9_20',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 9.20 — number dictation</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 twenty-one degrees Celsius. 2 two thirds. 3 forty-five point five per cent. 4 two million four hundred and seventy-eight thousand.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s5t5\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">1 —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">31°C</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">2/3</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">21°C</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">2 —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">3/4</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">2/3</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">21°C</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">3 —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">54.5%</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">21°C</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">45.5%</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">4 —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">2,478</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">2,478,000</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">21°C</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>twenty-one degrees · two thirds · forty-five point five per cent · two million four hundred and seventy-eight thousand.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Practice\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Practice</div>\n      <h2>Practice</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 — much, many, a little, a few?</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s6t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ rice do we need?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a lot</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ onions are there?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a lot</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Add a ___ oil — not a lot!\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">few</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">little</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">much</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Add a ___ raisins at the end.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">little</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">few</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">Don't drink too ___ coffee!\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a lot</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">much</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">There aren't ___ eggs — buy some more.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">too much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">enough</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">too many</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>rice/oil/coffee → much, a little · onions/raisins/eggs → many, a few, enough.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s6t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “How much carrots do we need?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">How many carrots do we need?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">How a lot of carrots do we need?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">How an lot of carrots do we need?</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Add a few oil.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Add a little oil.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Add a few oils.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Add an little oil.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “There is too many water.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There are too much waters.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">There is too much waters.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There is too much water.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>carrots → <b>many</b> · oil → <b>a little</b> · water → <b>too much</b>.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s6t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Do we have ___ rice at home?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">any</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">We need ___ carrots for the plov.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">any</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">There isn't ___ oil in the bottle.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">any</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>question/negative → any · positive → some.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Read\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Read</div>\n      <h2>Read</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">A recipe — and the numbers behind the rice.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s7t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">The two texts are about…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the history of plov.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">restaurants in Asia.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">how to cook a dish — and how much food countries grow.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>First the recipe, then the food numbers of three countries.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s7t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">You need half a kilo of beef.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">You must add a lot of water quickly.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Singapore grows most of its food.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">Papua New Guinea grows about three-quarters of its food.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">Indonesia imports rice.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Don't add <b>too much</b> water! Singapore grows <b>less than 10%</b>. Indonesia imports ~3 million tonnes.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s7t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">“Add ___ raisins at the end.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a little</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an little</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a few</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">“There isn't ___ land in a city-state.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">enough</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">too many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">too much</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">“One sixth of all Indonesians” — how do you write it?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">1.6</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">1/6</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">enough</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>raisins → <b>a few</b> · not <b>enough</b> land · one sixth = 1/6.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Before you read:</span> plov for six people — how much rice do you think you need?</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Listen\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Listen</div>\n      <h2>Listen</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Singapore, Papua New Guinea — and the rice giant Indonesia.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then choose the correct answers.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('9_10',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 9.10 — Papua New Guinea and Singapore</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 Papua New Guinea is 160 kilometres north of Australia. 2 Singapore grows less than 10% of its food. 3 Papua New Guinea grows about three-quarters of its food. 4 Singapore got independence in 1965. 5 The coldest temperature ever recorded in Singapore was 19.4 degrees Celsius. 6 Less than a quarter of people in Papua New Guinea live in cities.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s8t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Singapore grows ___ of its food.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">three-quarters</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">half</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">less than 10%</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Papua New Guinea grows about…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">10% of its food</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">10%s of its food</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">three-quarters of its food</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">How many people in PNG live in cities?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Less than a quarter</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">More than half</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Less than an quarter</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Singapore <10% · PNG ¾ · less than ¼ of PNG people live in cities.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('9_13',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 9.13 — Indonesia's farms</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">The country is 5,120 kilometres from east to west. Forty million Indonesians work on farms, which is 1/6th of all Indonesians. The climate is perfect for growing rice: the temperature is usually between 25 and 35 degrees Celsius. Indonesia is the third largest rice growing country in the world, but it still imports about three million tonnes of rice a year.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s8t6\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How many Indonesians work on farms?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Forty million — one sixth</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Four million — one third</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">About three million tonnes</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">How much rice does Indonesia import a year?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Nothing — it exports</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">About three million tonnes</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Forty million — one sixth</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>40,000,000 = 1/6 of Indonesians · and still ~3 million tonnes of imported rice.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Write your favourite simple recipe.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">Ingredients with quantities + five steps with cooking verbs.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>You need: half a kilo of… / two cups of…</li><li>a little… · a few…</li><li>First, chop / fry / boil…</li><li>Then add… and mix well.</li><li>Don't add too much…!</li><li>Serve it hot.</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Teach your partner your best recipe.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">They write the shopping list from your words. Then swap.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>You need half a kilo of…</li><li>a little… · a few…</li><li>How much…? How many…?</li><li>First… then… finally…</li><li>Don't add too much…!</li><li>Sounds delicious!</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Teach your teacher your best recipe.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">They write the shopping list from your words. Then swap roles.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>You need half a kilo of…</li><li>a little… · a few…</li><li>How much…? How many…?</li><li>First… then… finally…</li><li>Don't add too much…!</li><li>Sounds delicious!</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — explain your recipe: the ingredients with quantities (half a kilo of…, a few…, a little…) and five steps (First chop… then fry…).</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — your partner writes the SHOPPING LIST from what they hear. Check it together: is every quantity right?</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — swap roles.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — explain your recipe: the ingredients with quantities (half a kilo of…, a few…, a little…) and five steps (First chop… then fry…).</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — your teacher writes the SHOPPING LIST from what they hear. Check it together: is every quantity right?</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — swap roles.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 11 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s10t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ eggs do we need?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"many\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ milk is there?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"much\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">We don't have ___ chairs for everyone.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"enough\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>many + countable \\u00b7 much + uncountable \\u00b7 enough BEFORE the noun: enough money.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s10t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">How much eggs do we need?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How many eggs do we need?\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">There is too many salt.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There is too much salt.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">We don't have money enough.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"We don't have enough money.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>many + countable \\u00b7 much + uncountable \\u00b7 enough BEFORE the noun: enough money.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l22s10t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Say there is too much of it: salt<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There is too much salt.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Say there are not enough: chairs<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There aren't enough chairs.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Ask the quantity: sugar / we need<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How much sugar do we need?|How much sugar?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>many + countable \\u00b7 much + uncountable \\u00b7 enough BEFORE the noun: enough money.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 12 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}